{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026CKxGOvCFVI1793673555.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>馮盈盈早前獲邀出席活動，事後於社交平台上載了一系列美照，與粉絲分享活動上的華麗造型。</p><p></p><p>相片中，馮盈盈身穿一襲精緻的露肩閃鑽晚裝，兩側配以輕盈飄逸的長薄紗，顯得極具仙氣。她梳起溫婉的半扎髮型，配上精緻耳環，整體造型唯美大方，亦大方展現出優雅的姿態與無瑕美背。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"bd35f6b2-32b6-4fff-9bd8-e3df6e60e992.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026CcIEUm7iz51793673554.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"331a2b54-4694-43c4-8dad-f74b95ae09ef.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026AcQCixH1Jq1793673554.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>這組極具仙氣的活動靚相曝光後，隨即引來大批網民圍觀與留言讚賞，紛紛大讚馮盈盈十分靚女，完美駕馭這套高雅尊貴的盛裝。</p><h3></h3></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:03.552600+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:38:30.043030+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:39:39.484918+00:00","content_hash":"5956777d28fb1e6bb1ab8c2eb29544a2082faa93de92752cd9b6a7eabb8910b5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:03.552600+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}